Subject: [PATCH 16/25] Android: Appearance menu (Auto, Light, Dark) in the
 menu bar

An icon at the end of the menu bar shows the current color scheme
(half-filled for Auto, a sun for Light, a moon for Dark) and opens
Auto (follow the system), Light and Dark: the same setting as
Preferences > Color scheme, saved the same way.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
